        "english": "area 18 of Brodmann",
        "translation_uz": "area 18 of Brodmann (Ichki a'zo)",
        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Ichki a'zo): The Latin name for the Brodmann (1909) area 18 is area 18 of Brodmann.",
