        "category": "anatomy_organ",
        "type": "Organ",
        "type_uz": "Ichki a'zo",
        "english": "area 2 of Brodmann",
        "translation_uz": "area 2 of Brodmann (Ichki a'zo)",
        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Ichki a'zo): A region of the brain (Brodmann (1909) area 2) that contributes to neural processing within its functional domain.",
