        "type_uz": "Ichki a'zo",
        "english": "angular area 39",
        "translation_uz": "angular area 39 (Ichki a'zo)",
        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Ichki a'zo): A region of the brain (Brodmann (1909) area 39) that contributes to neural processing within its functional domain.",
        "slug": "/structure/brodmann-1909-area-39/",
