        "english": "",
        "translation_uz": "bursal follicle (Ichki a'zo)",
        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Ichki a'zo): Follicle within the plicae of bursa of Fabricius.",
        "slug": "/structure/bursal-follicle/",
