        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Suyak): Compound dermal and endochondral bone that results from the fusion of the paired dermal parietal bones and the median endochondral supraoccipital. Forms the dorso-posterior element of the dermatocranium.",
        "slug": "/structure/parietal-supraoccipital/",
        "description_en": "Compound dermal and endochondral bone that results from the fusion of the paired dermal parietal bones and the median endochondral supraoccipital. Forms the dorso-posterior element of the dermatocranium."
