        "translation_uz": "glomerular capillary tuft (Suyak)",
        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Suyak): A capillary tuft which forms a close network with the visceral epithelium (podocytes) and the mesangium to form the filtration barrier and is surrounded by Bowman&#x27;s capsule in nephrons of the vertebrate kidney[GO].",
