        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Asab tolasi (Nerv)): Barrier in the choroid plexus located in the lateral, third, and fourth brain ventricles that controls the entrance of substances into the cerebrospinal fluid from the blood[MP].",
        "slug": "/structure/blood-cerebrospinal-fluid-barrier/",
