        "translation_uz": "Eimer&#x27;s organ (Asab tolasi (Nerv))",
        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Asab tolasi (Nerv)): A sensory organ in which the epidermis is modified to form bulbous papillae. The organs are formed from a stack of epidermal cells, which is innervated by nerve processes from myelinated fibers in the dermis, which form terminal swellings just below the outer keratinized layer of epidermis. They contain a Merkel cell-neurite complex in the epidermis and a lamellated corpuscle in the dermal connective tissue.",
