        "translation_uz": "muscle of anterior abdominal wall (Mushak)",
        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Mushak): Any skeletal muscle organ that is part of a anterior abdominal wall. Examples: the obliques, pyramidalis and transversus abdominus.",
        "slug": "/structure/anterior-abdominal-wall-muscle/",
        "description_en": "Any skeletal muscle organ that is part of a anterior abdominal wall. Examples: the obliques, pyramidalis and transversus abdominus."
