        "translation_uz": "cricothyroid (Mushak)",
        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Mushak): Intrinsic muscle of the larynx, innervated by the external division of the laryngeal nerve, a branch of the vagus nerve. It attaches to the anterolateral surface of the cricoid cartilage and the external surface of the thyroid cartilage.",
        "slug": "/structure/cricothyroid-muscle/",
        "description_en": "Intrinsic muscle of the larynx, innervated by the external division of the laryngeal nerve, a branch of the vagus nerve. It attaches to the anterolateral surface of the cricoid cartilage and the external surface of the thyroid cartilage."
