        "english": "adrenal gland cortex",
        "translation_uz": "adrenal gland cortex (Bez)",
        "definition_uz": "Anatomik ta'rif (Bez): The thick outer layer of the adrenal gland that produces and secretes steroid hormones such as corticosterone, estrone and aldosterone.",
        "slug": "/structure/adrenal-cortex/",
